<title>USA: Tandy adds 5 mln shares to buyback program.</title>
<headline>Tandy adds 5 mln shares to buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tandy  Corp said on Monday it added 5 million shares to its ongoing buyback program, bringing the total authorized to 15 million.</p>
<p>Of those, 6.3 million have been repurchased since January 1996, the company said.</p>
<p>The shares are being repurchased on the open market. Tandy was trading at 50-1/4, down slightly from its Friday close of 50-3/8. The 52-week high was 59-1/8.</p>
<p>Tandy is a consumer-electronics retailer.</p>
</text>
